      <Docs>
        <summary>
          <para>The watch next type for NEXT. Use this type when the user has watched one or more complete episodes from some episodic content, but there remains more than one episode remaining or there is one last episode remaining, but it is not “new” in that it was released before the user started watching the show.</para>
          <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/media/tv/TvContract.WatchNextPrograms#WATCH_NEXT_TYPE_NEXT" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.media.tv.TvContract.WatchNextPrograms.WATCH_NEXT_TYPE_NEXT</code>.</a></format></para>
